cff-version: 1.2.0
title: JobFoundry
message: >-
  If you use JobFoundry in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: deadrat-in
    website: https://github.com/deadrat-in
repository-code: https://github.com/deadrat-in/JobFoundry
url: https://deadrat-in.github.io/JobFoundry/
abstract: >-
  Local-first, open-source platform for job discovery, fit assessment, and
  resume tailoring. Pairs a privacy-respecting browser extension (87 ATS/job
  board providers, zero-token extraction) with a local server (SimHash
  dedup, LLM fit scoring, truthful LangGraph resume tailoring) and a Kanban
  dashboard — keeping all career data under the user's control.
keywords:
  - job-search
  - resume-tailoring
  - applicant-tracking-system
  - local-first
  - privacy
  - browser-extension
  - large-language-models
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 0.4.0
